    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSix Mercer Drive is a superb A2-rated modern home that offers the perfect blend of space and natural light, thoughtfully designed for contemporary family living. Built in 2023 and still covered by a Homebound guarantee, the property combines modern construction with stylish finishes throughout. The current owners have further enhanced the home by converting the attic, creating two additional attic rooms and a bathroom, beautifully illuminated by west-facing skylights that fill the space with light.\n\nThe accommodation is arranged to maximise both comfort and functionality, currently totalling c150sqm comprising of three well-proportioned bedrooms with the principle being ensuite and a large family bathroom. At the heart of the home is a large kitchen and dining room, designed for modern family life, with doors that open directly onto a wonderful, landscaped garden ideal for outdoor dining and gatherings. There is a large utility off the kitchen, a guest WC and a bright and spacious living room that provides an inviting setting for relaxing or entertaining on the ground floor. Parking for two cars to the side of the property. \nSustainability and efficiency are at the heart of this home. Powered by a modern heat pump system, the property delivers excellent comfort levels while maintaining low running costs. The combination of advanced energy efficiency, stylish finishes, and abundant natural light makes this a truly special purchase.\n\nCherrywood itself is a highly sought-after location with excellent transport links, including the Luas Green Line, and convenient access to the M50 motorway and M11 motorway. The property is also close to Cabinteely Village, with its charming amenities, while a selection of excellent schools and local facilities further enhances the appeal of this vibrant and well-connected community."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Special Features</li><li> Superb A2-rated energy-efficient home</li><li> Built in 2023 and still covered by a Homebound structural guarantee</li><li> Modern heat pump system ensuring comfort with low running costs</li><li> Beautifully presented with a perfect blend of space and natural light</li><li> Attic conversion providing two additional attic rooms and a bathroom</li><li> West-facing skylights in the attic allowing excellent evening light</li><li> Currently laid out with three spacious bedrooms</li><li> Bright and spacious living room ideal for relaxing and entertaining</li><li> Large contemporary kitchen / dining room designed for modern family living</li><li> Double doors leading to a wonderful landscaped rear garden</li><li> Parking for two cars to the side of the property</li><li> Excellent storage throughout</li><li> Designed with a real sense of openness and exclusivity</li><li> Located close to the Luas Green Line</li><li> Easy access to the M50 motorway and M11 motorway</li><li> Close to Cabinteely Village with a range of shops and amenities</li><li> Excellent selection of schools and local facilities nearby</li><li> Located in the thriving and well-connected community of Cherrywood</ul>"
      },
